        "r": 532.8700000000002,
        "b": 708.7
      },
      "content": "With the tabs disengaged the front of the cover is released. Rotate the front of the cover away from the printer (callout 1) to release the rear of the cover (callout 2), and then remove it."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1584",
      "reading_order": 2054,
      "section": "NOTE: Stapler models only.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 91.0,
        "t": 458.42,
        "r": 253.63999999999993,
        "b": 446.83
      },
      "content": "Unpack the replacement assembly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1585",
      "reading_order": 2055,
      "section": "NOTE: Stapler models only.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 113.0,
        "t": 437.42,
        "r": 252.10999999999987,
        "b": 425.83
      },
      "content": "Dispose of the defective part."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1586",
      "reading_order": 2056,
      "section": "NOTE: Stapler models only.",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 135.0,
        "t": 413.92,
        "r": 404.8599999999999,
        "b": 402.33
      },
      "content": "NOTE: HP recommends responsible disposal of the defective part."
    },
